    "title": "How Meta is ramping up cleantech investments amid the AI boom - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lamar Johnson Zoya Mirza ,\n2 days ago Large tech companies with bets on artificial intelligence and net-zero commitments have increasingly looked towards a wider array of clean energy technologies to support data center consumption. Lawmakers included a speedy wind down for solar and wind tax credits in the One Big Beautiful Bill Act, but clean energy investments are still increasing, albeit in a more diversified manner. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
